# ── Docker image (required) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pin the exact relay version the Compatibility Table lists for your TrueSeal
# Release. `:latest` is never a valid value (release gate G8); the compose
# file refuses to start without an explicit, exact tag.
#
# Find published versions: https://github.com/julianbonomini/trueseal-relay/releases
RELAY_IMAGE=ghcr.io/julianbonomini/trueseal-relay:v0.2.0

# ── Keypair (optional) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# By default, a keypair is auto-generated on first run and stored in the
# relay-data Docker volume at /data/keypair.hex.
#
# To bring your own keypair (e.g. to restore a known public key after
# redeployment), set the hex-encoded X25519 private key here.
# Generate one with: docker compose run --rm relay genkey -keyout /data/keypair.hex
#
# TRUESEAL_RELAY_KEYPAIR_HEX=your_hex_encoded_private_key_here

# ── Optional overrides ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# All values below have sensible defaults. Uncomment to override.
#
# TRUESEAL_RELAY_TTL=720h
# TRUESEAL_RELAY_REAP_INTERVAL=1h
# TRUESEAL_RELAY_MAX_CONNECTIONS=1000
